--- !u!114 &34435845
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 34435842}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5f7201a12d95ffc409449d95f23cf332, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: UnityEngine.UI::UnityEngine.UI.Text
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 0.2, g: 0.2, b: 0.42, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_FontData:
    m_Font: {fileID: 12800000, guid: b7ffa67c5b8c8944a936bd2c9be46645, type: 3}
    m_FontSize: 28
    m_FontStyle: 0
    m_BestFit: 0
    m_MinSize: 10
    m_MaxSize: 40
    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 1
    m_LineSpacing: 1.05
  m_Text: "\n<color=#E0A100><size=36>\u25CF </size></color><color=#2B3A9E><size=36><b>C\xE1ch th\u1EAFng</b></size></color>\n\u2022 S\u1EDF h\u1EEFu tr\u1ECDn th\xE0nh ph\u1ED1 c\u1EE7a <b>3 qu\u1ED1c gia b\u1EA5t k\u1EF3</b>: th\u1EAFng ngay.\n\u2022 S\u1EDF h\u1EEFu <b>c\u1EA3 4 b\xE3i bi\u1EC3n</b>: th\u1EAFng ngay.\n\u2022 Ch\u1EC9 c\xF2n <b>m\u1ED9t ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01B0a ph\xE1 s\u1EA3n</b>: ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\xF3 th\u1EAFng.\n\u2022 H\u1EBFt gi\u1EDD (30 / 45 / 60 ph\xFAt): so <b>ti\u1EC1n m\u1EB7t</b>, h\xF2a th\xEC so <b>t\u1ED5ng gi\xE1 b\u1EA5t \u0111\u1ED9ng s\u1EA3n</b>, v\u1EABn h\xF2a th\xEC \u0111\u1ED3ng th\u1EAFng. Ch\u1EBF \u0111\u1ED9 v\xF4 h\u1EA1n kh\xF4ng t\xEDnh gi\u1EDD.\n\n<color=#E0A100><size=36>\u25CF </size></color><color=#2B3A9E><size=36><b>Chu\u1EA9n b\u1ECB</b></size></color>\n\u2022 2\u20134 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi, ch\u01A1i v\u1EDBi Bot ho\u1EB7c nhi\u1EC1u ng\u01B0\u1EDDi tr\xEAn c\xF9ng m\u1ED9t m\xE1y; \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c tr\xF9ng ngh\u1EC1.\n\u2022 M\u1ED7i ng\u01B0\u1EDDi c\xF3 <b>300.000\u0111</b>, b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u \u1EDF \xF4 Xu\u1EA5t ph\xE1t. Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111i \u0111\u1EA7u ch\u1ECDn ng\u1EABu nhi\xEAn.\n\u2022 \u0110\u1EA7u tr\u1EADn ch\u1ECDn ng\u1EABu nhi\xEAn <b>3 th\xE0nh ph\u1ED1 l\u1EC5 h\u1ED9i</b> (+50% ti\u1EC1n thu\xEA su\u1ED1t tr\u1EADn), c\xF3 vi\u1EC1n \u0111\xE8n v\xE0 b\xF3ng bay.\n\n<color=#E0A100><size=36>\u25CF </size></color><color=#2B3A9E><size=36><b>M\u1ED9t l\u01B0\u1EE3t ch\u01A1i</b></size></color>\n\u2022 Tung hai x\xFAc x\u1EAFc r\u1ED3i \u0111i theo t\u1ED5ng \u0111i\u1EC3m.\n\u2022 <b>Ra \u0111\xF4i</b> \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c tung ti\u1EBFp, kh\xF4ng gi\u1EDBi h\u1EA1n, v\u1EABn t\xEDnh l\xE0 c\xF9ng m\u1ED9t l\u01B0\u1EE3t.\n\u2022 \u0110i qua ho\u1EB7c d\u1EEBng \u1EDF \xF4 Xu\u1EA5t ph\xE1t nh\u1EADn <b>200.000\u0111</b>.\n\u2022 X\u1EED l\xFD \xF4 v\u1EEBa \u0111\u1EBFn, d\xF9ng k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng n\u1EBFu mu\u1ED1n, r\u1ED3i b\u1EA5m K\u1EBFt th\xFAc l\u01B0\u1EE3t.\n\n<color=#E0A100><size=36>\u25CF </size></color><color=#2B3A9E><size=36><b>Th\xE0nh ph\u1ED1</b></size></color>\n\u2022 20 th\xE0nh ph\u1ED1 thu\u1ED9c 8 qu\u1ED1c gia. C\u1EA5p: C\u1ECDc \u2192 Nh\xE0 1 \u2192 Nh\xE0 2 \u2192 Nh\xE0 3 \u2192 Kh\xE1ch s\u1EA1n.\n\u2022 Gi\xE1 m\u1ED7i c\u1EA5p so v\u1EDBi gi\xE1 Nh\xE0 3: <b>40% / 60% / 80% / 100% / 120%</b>.\n\u2022 Ti\u1EC1n thu\xEA = 5% gi\xE1 Nh\xE0 3 \xD7 <b>1,5 / 2,5 / 4 / 6 / 8</b> theo c\u1EA5p.\n\u2022 \u0110\u1EA5t ch\u01B0a ch\u1EE7: mua C\u1ECDc \u0111\u1EBFn Nh\xE0 3, ho\u1EB7c b\u1ECF qua. Kh\xF4ng mua th\u1EB3ng Kh\xE1ch s\u1EA1n.\n\u2022 D\u1EEBng l\u1EA1i \u0111\u1EA5t m\xECnh: n\xE2ng c\u1EA5p m\u1ED9t l\u1EA7n, tr\u1EA3 ph\u1EA7n ch\xEAnh l\u1EC7ch. Kh\xE1ch s\u1EA1n ch\u1EC9 n\xE2ng \u1EDF l\u1EA7n d\u1EEBng sau khi \u0111\xE3 c\xF3 Nh\xE0 3.\n\u2022 <b>\u0110\u1ED9c quy\u1EC1n m\u1ED9t n\u01B0\u1EDBc</b> (\u0111\u1EE7 m\u1ECDi th\xE0nh ph\u1ED1 c\u1EE7a n\u01B0\u1EDBc \u0111\xF3): +20% ti\u1EC1n thu\xEA.\n\n<color=#E0A100><size=36>\u25CF </size></color><color=#2B3A9E><size=36><b>B\xE3i bi\u1EC3n</b></size></color>\n\u2022 4 b\xE3i \u1EDF \xF4 4, 14, 18, 25; gi\xE1 100.000 / 130.000 / 160.000 / 190.000\u0111. Kh\xF4ng n\xE2ng c\u1EA5p.\n\u2022 Ti\u1EC1n thu\xEA m\u1ED7i b\xE3i theo s\u1ED1 b\xE3i c\xF9ng ch\u1EE7: 1 b\xE3i <b>50.000</b>, 2 b\xE3i <b>100.000</b>, 3 b\xE3i <b>150.000\u0111</b>.\n\n<color=#E0A100><size=36>\u25CF </size></color><color=#2B3A9E><size=36><b>Mua l\u1EA1i \u0111\u1EA5t \u0111\u1ED1i th\u1EE7</b></size></color>\n\u2022 D\u1EEBng \u1EDF th\xE0nh ph\u1ED1 \u0111\u1ED1i th\u1EE7 (C\u1ECDc \u0111\u1EBFn Nh\xE0 3): tr\u1EA3 ti\u1EC1n thu\xEA tr\u01B0\u1EDBc, sau \u0111\xF3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ch\u1ECDn <b>mua l\u1EA1i</b> v\u1EDBi <b>200%</b> gi\xE1 ni\xEAm y\u1EBFt. Ch\u1EE7 c\u0169 kh\xF4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c t\u1EEB ch\u1ED1i.\n\u2022 Kh\xF4ng mua l\u1EA1i \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c Kh\xE1ch s\u1EA1n v\xE0 b\xE3i bi\u1EC3n.\n\n<color=#E0A100><size=36>\u25CF </size></color><color=#2B3A9E><size=36><b>B\xE1n t\xE0i s\u1EA3n v\xE0 ph\xE1 s\u1EA3n</b></size></color>\n\u2022 C\xF3 th\u1EC3 b\xE1n cho ng\xE2n h\xE0ng tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi tung ho\u1EB7c sau khi x\u1EED l\xFD xong \xF4; nh\u1EADn <b>50% v\u1ED1n \u0111\xE3 b\u1ECF ra</b>.\n\u2022 Ph\u1EA3i tr\u1EA3 ti\u1EC1n (thu\xEA, thu\u1EBF, ph\u1EA1t, n\u1EE3) m\xE0 kh\xF4ng \u0111\u1EE7 th\xEC thanh l\xFD t\xE0i s\u1EA3n. V\u1EABn thi\u1EBFu th\xEC <b>ph\xE1 s\u1EA3n</b>; t\xE0i s\u1EA3n v\u1EC1 ng\xE2n h\xE0ng.\n\n<color=#E0A100><size=36>\u25CF </size></color><color=#2B3A9E><size=36><b>\xD4 \u0111\u1EB7c bi\u1EC7t</b></size></color>\n\u2022 <b>Th\u1EBB s\u1EF1 ki\u1EC7n</b>: r\xFAt ng\u1EABu nhi\xEAn m\u1ED9t trong 14 th\u1EBB.\n\u2022 <b>T\u1ED5 ch\u1EE9c s\u1EF1 ki\u1EC7n (\xF4 16)</b>: tr\u1EA3 200.000\u0111 \u0111\u1EC3 t\u1ED5 ch\u1EE9c l\u1EC5 h\u1ED9i t\u1EA1i m\u1ED9t th\xE0nh ph\u1ED1 c\u1EE7a m\xECnh. L\xE0m ti\u1EBFp \u1EDF \u0111\xFAng th\xE0nh ph\u1ED1 \u0111\xF3 th\xEC c\u1ED9ng th\xEAm 50% m\u1ED7i l\u1EA7n; \u0111\u1ED5i th\xE0nh ph\u1ED1 ho\u1EB7c ng\u01B0\u1EDDi kh\xE1c t\u1ED5 ch\u1EE9c th\xEC l\u1EC5 h\u1ED9i c\u0169 m\u1EA5t.\n\u2022 <b>D\u1ECBch chuy\u1EC3n (\xF4 24)</b>: tr\u1EA3 100.000\u0111 r\u1ED3i b\u1EA5m v\xE0o \xF4 mu\u1ED1n bay t\u1EDBi.\n\u2022 <b>Thu\u1EBF (\xF4 30)</b>: n\u1ED9p 20% t\u1ED5ng t\xE0i s\u1EA3n (ti\u1EC1n m\u1EB7t + gi\xE1 b\u1EA5t \u0111\u1ED9ng s\u1EA3n).\n\n<color=#E0A100><size=36>\u25CF </size></color><color=#2B3A9E><size=36><b>Nh\xE0 t\xF9 (\xF4 8)</b></size></color>\n\u2022 D\u1EEBng v\xE0o th\xEC b\u1ECB giam, \u0111i ngang th\xEC kh\xF4ng. V\u1EABn thu ti\u1EC1n thu\xEA khi \u0111ang \u1EDF t\xF9.\n\u2022 M\u1ED7i l\u01B0\u1EE3t ch\u1ECDn: tung \u0111\xF4i \u0111\u1EC3 ra, tr\u1EA3 200.000\u0111, ho\u1EB7c d\xF9ng th\u1EBB Ra t\xF9.\n\u2022 T\u1ED1i \u0111a 3 l\u01B0\u1EE3t. L\u01B0\u1EE3t th\u1EE9 3 tung kh\xF4ng \u0111\xF4i th\xEC b\u1EAFt bu\u1ED9c tr\u1EA3 200.000\u0111 v\xE0 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c th\u1EA3 cu\u1ED1i l\u01B0\u1EE3t.\n\n<color=#E0A100><size=36>\u25CF </size></color><color=#2B3A9E><size=36><b>M\u01B0\u1EDDi b\u1ED1n th\u1EBB s\u1EF1 ki\u1EC7n</b></size></color>\n\u2022 Ti\u1EC1n th\u01B0\u1EDFng: nh\u1EADn 300.000\u0111.\n\u2022 \u0110\u1ED9ng \u0111\u1EA5t: h\u1EA1 m\u1ED9t c\u1EA5p Nh\xE0 1\u20133 c\u1EE7a \u0111\u1ED1i th\u1EE7.\n\u2022 Mi\u1EC5n thu\u1EBF (gi\u1EEF l\u1EA1i).\n\u2022 Gi\u1EA3m 50% ti\u1EC1n thu\xEA (gi\u1EEF l\u1EA1i).\n\u2022 B\u1EA3o v\u1EC7 c\xF4ng tr\xECnh (gi\u1EEF l\u1EA1i, t\u1EF1 k\xEDch ho\u1EA1t).\n\u2022 N\u1ED9p ph\u1EA1t thu\u1EBF: 20% t\u1ED5ng t\xE0i s\u1EA3n.\n\u2022 V\xE0o nh\xE0 t\xF9.\n\u2022 Ra t\xF9 (gi\u1EEF l\u1EA1i).\n\u2022 Ph\xE1 t\xE0i s\u1EA3n: ph\xE1 m\u1ED9t th\xE0nh ph\u1ED1 \u0111\u1ED1i th\u1EE7 (C\u1ECDc\u2013Nh\xE0 3), ch\u1EE7 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ho\xE0n v\u1ED1n.\n\u2022 Qu\xE0 t\u1EEB \u0111\u1ED1i th\u1EE7: m\u1ED7i \u0111\u1ED1i th\u1EE7 \u0111\u01B0a b\u1EA1n 100.000\u0111.\n\u2022 \u0110\u1EBFn \xF4 d\u1ECBch chuy\u1EC3n.\n\u2022 T\u1ED5 ch\u1EE9c l\u1EC5 h\u1ED9i: t\xF9y ch\u1ECDn tr\u1EA3 200.000\u0111.\n\u2022 C\xFAp \u0111i\u1EC7n: m\u1ED9t th\xE0nh ph\u1ED1 \u0111\u1ED1i th\u1EE7 kh\xF4ng thu \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ti\u1EC1n thu\xEA trong 3 l\u01B0\u1EE3t c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n.\n\u2022 T\u1EB7ng qu\xE0: \u0111\u01B0a m\u1ED9t \u0111\u1ED1i th\u1EE7 200.000\u0111.\nM\u1ED7i lo\u1EA1i th\u1EBB gi\u1EEF ch\u1EC9 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c m\u1ED9t l\xE1. Kh\xE1ch s\u1EA1n v\xE0 b\xE3i bi\u1EC3n kh\xF4ng b\u1ECB ph\xE1 ho\u1EA1i.\n\n<color=#E0A100><size=36>\u25CF </size></color><color=#2B3A9E><size=36><b>S\xE1u ngh\u1EC1 nghi\u1EC7p</b></size></color>\nM\u1ED7i ngh\u1EC1 c\xF3 n\u1ED9i t\u1EA1i, k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng ch\u1EE7 \u0111\u1ED9ng (h\u1ED3i theo l\u01B0\u1EE3t c\u1EE7a m\xECnh), chi\xEAu cu\u1ED1i d\xF9ng m\u1ED9t l\u1EA7n m\u1ED7i tr\u1EADn v\xE0 \u0111i\u1EC3m y\u1EBFu:\n\u2022 <b>Nh\xE0 \u0110\u1EA7u T\u01B0</b>: mua \u0111\u1EA5t t\u1EEB ng\xE2n h\xE0ng r\u1EBB h\u01A1n; chi\xEAu cu\u1ED1i mua l\u1EA1i t\u1EEB xa v\u1EDBi 150%; n\xE2ng c\u1EA5p \u0111\u1EAFt h\u01A1n 10%.\n\u2022 <b>Doanh Nh\xE2n</b>: thu thu\xEA nhi\u1EC1u h\u01A1n; chi\xEAu cu\u1ED1i nh\xE2n \u0111\xF4i ti\u1EC1n thu\xEA; mua \u0111\u1EA5t \u0111\u1EAFt h\u01A1n 5%.\n\u2022 <b>K\u1EF9 S\u01B0</b>: n\xE2ng c\u1EA5p r\u1EBB h\u01A1n, n\xE2ng t\u1EEB xa; chi\xEAu cu\u1ED1i l\xEAn th\u1EB3ng Kh\xE1ch s\u1EA1n; ti\u1EC1n thu\xEA c\u01A1 b\u1EA3n gi\u1EA3m 10%.\n\u2022 <b>Lu\u1EADt S\u01B0</b>: gi\u1EA3m thu\u1EBF t\u1EEB th\u1EBB, h\u1EE7y m\u1ED9t l\u1EA7n tr\u1EA3 thu\xEA; chi\xEAu cu\u1ED1i mi\u1EC5n c\xE1c kho\u1EA3n b\u1EAFt bu\u1ED9c trong l\u01B0\u1EE3t.\n\u2022 <b>Banker</b>: l\xE3i 1% ti\u1EC1n m\u1EB7t m\u1ED7i v\xF2ng, vay 100.000 tr\u1EA3 110.000; chi\xEAu cu\u1ED1i nh\u1EADn 200.000\u0111.\n\u2022 <b>Nh\xE0 Chi\u1EBFn L\u01B0\u1EE3c</b>: xem tr\u01B0\u1EDBc th\u1EBB k\u1EBF ti\u1EBFp, tung l\u1EA1i x\xFAc x\u1EAFc; chi\xEAu cu\u1ED1i ch\u1ECDn \xF4 trong 1\u20136 b\u01B0\u1EDBc.\n"
